  "notes": "USAGE:\nAlso used as a suru-verb: {万引|まんび}きする (to shoplift). Can also refer to the person who shoplifts ({万引|まんび}き{犯|はん} is more specific). Store signs often use the phrase {万引|まんび}きは{犯罪|はんざい}です (shoplifting is a crime).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {万引|まんび}きする (to shoplift)\n- {万引|まんび}き{犯|はん} (shoplifter)\n- {万引|まんび}き{防止|ぼうし} (shoplifting prevention)\n- {万引|まんび}きで{捕|つか}まる (to be caught shoplifting)",
